    "name": "3Dtrees: Point cloud processing",
    "readme": "Single-file workflow for the 3Dtrees tutorial on Galaxy Europe. Use Strip-20210804-150144_D.las from DOI 10.15454/DMYWPB. SmartTile creates processing collections internally; separate flight areas are not combined. Named outputs support the accompanying Planemo test. SegmentAnyTree requires a Galaxy server with GPU execution configured.",
